<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo forex market closed for New Year holiday.</title>
<headline>Colombo forex market closed for New Year holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo foreign exchange market was closed on Monday for Sinhala and Tamil New Year holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the last trading day, the rupee closed lower against the dollar at 58.86 after opening at 58.80.</p>
<p>-- Colombo Newsroom (94-1-434319)</p>
</text>
